<title>THAILAND: National Finance H1 net down 26 percent.</title>
<headline>National Finance H1 net down 26 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reviewed financial results for the first six months ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     Six months</p>
<p>				   1996			1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 2.49     vs	     4.24</p>
